    <string name="help_step_1">On your computer, run scripts/dev.sh. It builds, installs, grants permissions, starts the Desktop Head Unit and retries until connected.</string>
    <string name="help_step_2">On the phone, open Android Auto, tap the three-dot menu and choose Start head unit server. This cannot be automated and must be repeated after every Desktop Head Unit session.</string>
    <string name="help_step_3">Open AutoScope in the car launcher. Grant permissions from the Hardware tab or More &gt; Permissions in the car only if some are still missing.</string>
    <string name="help_first_time">First time only: enable developer mode by tapping Version about 10 times in Android Auto settings.</string>
